 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All five planned kinds kept. Old JetPens model lists restructured into archetypes (Blackwing 602 with its owners, Mono 100, Hi-Uni, Kuru Toga family, Orenz, Rotring Tikky into Rotring 600/800, Staedtler Mars Technico 780). Old range Tombow MONO folded into Mono 100 archetype; Pentel Ain range kept as a lead model. Not added: Staedtler Noris, Caran d'Ache Swiss Wood, Platinum Pro-Use, Rotring and Hi-Uni launch years, Blackwing slogan source beyond Wikipedia (no retrieved page for the others); Pentel P203/205/207/209 named only by series. Brand facts for Koh-i-Noor, Faber-Castell, Uni, Tombow, Staedtler, Rotring, Zebra, Pilot, Caran d'Ache from knowledge; KUM, Carl, Dahle founding years left blank. architecturelab.net blocked WebFetch and was retrieved via firecrawl."
